  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of a climate-proof urban strategy for Kremenchuk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity focuses on creating a climate-proof urban strategy for Kremenchuk to address challenges such as energy scarcity, biodiversity enhancement, and circular economy integration. Building on a quick scan and partnership with local stakeholders, the project will develop actionable solutions for sustainable urban planning, integrating energy-efficient infrastructure, renewable energy, and green landscape design. The initiative aligns with Ukraine&apos;s national energy transition goals and international commitments such as the European Green Deal and the United Nations (UN) Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs 11 and 13), positioning Kremenchuk as a model for sustainable urban development across Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
